aluable, and I’m excited to shape the future of <i>Timbertales</i> based on community input. Be sure to check the latest announcements for ongoing development updates!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673480/extras/5c97238a56c7d19a8a32e1f45edd7dc5.avif?t=1733316604\" width=616 height=99 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fractions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Timbertales</i> features two main factions: <strong>Vermin</strong> and <strong>Sylvans</strong>. Each faction consists of a variety of unique heroes, each with its own abilities and roles—ranging from ranged DPS to melee DPS, support, healing, and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Campaign</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story mode of <i>Timbertales</i> introduces you to the Sylvans through a brief tutorial, a prologue, and their dedicated campaign. The Sylvan campaign consists of several missions, each designed to challenge your tactical skills. The Vermin campaign is coming soon!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the captivating world of <i>Timbertales</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tackle innovative mission objectives and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete missions to unlock special achievements </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673480/extras/9d1fe46a93d1568941bfb74ac1a15057.avif?t=1733316604\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unique game mode, you'll draft an army from limited options and face off against a progressively more difficult AI. Each victory increases the challenge level and your rewards.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your skills in a dynamic, ever-escalating challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn epic rewards with each victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the special challenge ranking </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spheres</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated units have a chance to drop special spheres, each with unique effects:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Healing Spheres</strong>: Restore health to your units</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Critical Strike Spheres</strong>: Increase critical strike chance for several rounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Acorn Point Spheres</strong>: Boost your acorn points, the in-game currency used to unlock features </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Maps</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Challenge mode feature special maps with optional objectives. Completing these objectives can trigger events that offer strategic advantages in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/673480/extras/ac1e8bd14619a7711a7f8def85befd47.avif?t=1733316604\" width=600 height=347 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Timbertales is inspired by classic strategy games such as:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battle Isle</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battle World: Kronos</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Advanced Wars</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Battle for Wesnoth</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Jagged Alliance</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to create a game that evokes the feeling of the strategy games I loved growing up, but with a fresh twist—a unique nature theme and deep, challenging gameplay. Unlike 4X strategy games, <i>Timbertales</i> doesn’t involve producing new units during battle. Instead, it adopts a tabletop-like approach, where you must carefully plan and prepare your army before each battle begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character in <i>Timbertales</i> has their own distinct abilities and playstyle. You’ll choose between standard attacks or using special abilities such as healing, curses, and powerful offensive skills. And stay tuned—more diverse abilities and heroes are on the way! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more information please visit Twitter / Facebook and my website :) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I am looking forward for your support, feedback and comments.</p>",
